    date "2019-06-18T10:44:18Z"
    title "Blockchain Technology Tutorial | Explained"
    description "1. What is Blockchain? | Technology behind Bitcoin &amp;#8211; 00:05&amp;#10;2. Blockchain | Prerequisites &amp;#8211; 09:28&amp;#10;3. Cryptography in Blockchain &amp;#8211; 17:04&amp;#10;4. Types of Cryptography &amp;#8211; 22:29&amp;#10;5. Digital Signature &amp;#8211; 26:41&amp;#10;6. Nodes in Blockchain &amp;#8211; 30:04&amp;#10;7. Hashing in Blockchain &amp;#8211; 34:14&amp;#10;8. Merkle Tree | Merkle Root &amp;#8211; 39:56&amp;#10;9. Blockchain Technology Architecture &amp;#8211; 42:15&amp;#10;10. Types of Blockchain &amp;#8211; 48:59             &amp;#10;11. Consensus in Blockchain &amp;#8211; 52:15&amp;#10;12. Proof of Work in Blockchain &amp;#8211; 56:21&amp;#10;13. What is Ethereum? &amp;#8211; 01:01:09&amp;#10;14. Smart Contract | Ethereum &amp;#8211; 01:04:35&amp;#10;15. Drawbacks of Blockchain &amp;#8211; 01:07:47&amp;#10;16. What is Hyperledger? &amp;#8211; 01:14:01&amp;#10;17. First Smart Contract (Part 1) | Metamask setup | Blockchain | Ethereum &amp;#8211; 01:17:19&amp;#10;18. First Smart Contract (Part 2) | Remix | Ethereum | Blockchain &amp;#8211; 01:26:33&amp;#10;19. First Smart Contract (Part 3) | RinkeBy | Ethereum | Blockchain &amp;#8211; 01:35:37&amp;#10;20. Smart Contract with Front End &amp;#8211; 01:41:04&amp;#10;21. Smart Contract with Web Front End (Part 2) &amp;#8211; 01:55:25"
