    title "Profitable Business Ideas for the Next 10 Years | Crypto, Blockchain"
    description "In this video, we're going to talk about business ideas on web 3.0 that have a good chance of taking over the world in the next 10 years. We're going to look at different markets and how they're currently being transformed with the help of blockchain.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;106 million people are now using cryptocurrencies around the world - https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/currencies/crypto-users-pass-100-million-boomers-gen-x-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-2021-2&amp;#10;46 Million Americans Now Own Bitcoin - https://www.newsweek.com/46-million-americans-now-own-bitcoin-crypto-goes-mainstream-1590639&amp;#10;13% of Americans traded crypto in the past year. By comparison, 24% of Americans invested in stocks over the same time period - https://www.cnbc.com/2021/07/23/13percent-of-americans-traded-crypto-in-the-past-year-survey-finds.html&amp;#10;Institutional Investors Now Hold $70B Of Bitcoin - https://finance.yahoo.com/news/institutional-investors-now-hold-70b-122022840.html&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Timestamps:&amp;#10;00:00 Crypto is taking over the world&amp;#10;01:59 What is a smart contract&amp;#10;03:40 What is web 3.0&amp;#10;06:07 Why now is the best time to start&amp;#10;07:00 Real estate&amp;#10;08:09 Creator economy&amp;#10;11:47 ID and elections&amp;#10;14:44 Healthcare, education, banking&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to my substack: https://marinamogilko.substack.com/ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I post daily stories about my life and business routine on my Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/linguamarina/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; ENROLL IN MY YOUTUBE COURSE - https://bit.ly/3dQuMId&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; DOWNLOAD MY ENGLISH WORKBOOK - https://marinamogilko.co/workbook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128176; INVESTMENT APPS &amp;#38; BOOKS:&amp;#10;- BlockFi - https://blockfi.com/?ref=5cc7c2c0  (I keep 1% of my portfolio here (9% interest rate)&amp;#10;- CoinBase - https://www.coinbase.com/join/mogilk_1?src=ios-link&amp;#10;- Binance - https://accounts.binanc