    date "2021-06-26T05:00:21Z"
    title "Introduction to Blockchain Security Issues  Vulnerabilities | Blockchain Security Explained"
    description "Get Certified in Blockchain Technology. Both tech and Non-Tech can apply!&amp;#10;10% off on Blockchain Certifications. Use Coupon Code - blockchain10&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3ND4QAl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blockchain security is primarily defined by the type of blockchain network being used, as these networks can differ in who can participate and who has access to the data. They are typically labeled as either public or private, which describes who is allowed to participate, and permissioned or permissionless, which describes how participants gain access to the network.&amp;#10;In this video, we'll be discussing various blockchain security issues and challenges alongside the use cases where some blockchain vulnerabilities have caused a serious business impact. At the end of this video, you'll have a fair understanding how blockchain security functions and what are various security issues in blockchain technology.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video Walkthrough&amp;#10;0:00 Introduction&amp;#10;0:19 Types of Blockchain &amp;#38; Security Implications&amp;#10;1:39 Is Blockchain Really Secure?&amp;#10;2:26 Some Blockchain Security Incidents &amp;#38; What Caused Them&amp;#10;4:10 Is Blockchain Safe: The Verdict&amp;#10;4:25 Blockchain Security Issues &amp;#38; Vulnerabilities&amp;#10;11:21 Conclusion: Security in Blockchain Technology&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Recommended Videos,&amp;#10;Types of Blockchain Explained | Blockchain Types&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FcfPU3rYVAk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What is Forking in Blockchain | Blockchain Forks Explained&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YSKC_8N_ABM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What is Hashing in Blockchain | Blockchain Hashing Explained&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Nbia23Ju_E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Proof of Work vs Proof of Stake vs Proof of Authority Explained&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2EabDUGIkBg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What are Smart Contracts in Blockchain, its Importance &amp;#38; How Smart Contracts Work&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hb5lifYSJt8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What is Tokenomics Explained | Tokenomics 101: Everything You Need To Know&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=38CQ6l5bxEI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blockchain vs Hashgraph vs DAG vs Holochain | Types of DLT Explained&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JjMWrXqsrUs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blockchain Prerequisites | Blockchain Learning Path to Kickstart Your Journey&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SP9UGROYE5E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;28+ Important Blockchain Terms Explained | Blockchain Terminology&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-VwTgmaNa2g&amp;#10;&amp;#10;7 Skills Needed to Become a Blockchain Developer&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x9l3y0cdpuU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Introduction to Cryptography in Blockchain (Explained)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QUG-T3E05P4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;60+ Top Cryptocurrency Explained Simply in 10 Minutes&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MeOwCeVfkpc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Got feedback on this video? Feel free to share your views in the comment section below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Reference links:&amp;#10;Understanding The DAO Attack&amp;#10;https://www.coindesk.com/understanding-dao-hack-journalists&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bitcoin worth $72 million stolen from Bitfinex exchange in Hong Kong&amp;#10;https://www.reuters.com/article/us-bitfinex-hacked-hongkong-idUSKCN10E0KP&amp;#10;&amp;#10;South Korea's Bithumb loses $32 million in digital money heist&amp;#10;https://www.reuters.com/article/uk-crypto-currencies-southkorea-idUKKBN1JG05B&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3 ISPs can see 60% of all the world's Bitcoin traffic&amp;#10;https://btc-hijack.ethz.ch&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Let's get social!&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/brandlitic&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/brandlitic&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/brandlitic&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Official Medium.com Publication: https://medium.com/brandlitic&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Crypto #Blockchain #BlockchainTechnology #BlockchainDeveloper #Bitcoin #Ethereum #BlockchainSecurity"
