    date "2019-06-16T15:40:29Z"
    title "Blockchain Explained in Sinhala"
    description "A blockchain, originally block chain, is a growing list of records, called blocks, which are linked using cryptography.Each block contains a cryptographic hash of the previous block, a timestamp, and transaction data (generally represented as a Merkle tree). We discuss about block chain in a basic level in this video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;__________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Find us on:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Facebook&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/live.wizardlk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Twitter&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/Wizard_LK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/wizard_lk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;GitHub&amp;#10;https://github.com/wizardlk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#WizTips   #wizardlk  #blockchain"
