    date "2019-12-28T05:00:05Z"
    title "Inside The Cryptocurrency Revolution"
    description "Bitcoin&amp;#8217;s emergence as a global digital currency has been as revolutionary as it has been erratic. But while fledgling investors obsess over every fluctuation in the cryptocurrency market, nation-states are more interested in the underlying blockchain technology and its ability to revolutionize how business is done on the internet and beyond. VICE's Michael Moynihan travels to Russia with Vitalik Buterin, inventor of the ethereum blockchain, to get a front-row seat to the geopolitical tug of war over Internet 3.0.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to VICE News here: http://bit.ly/Subscribe-to-VICE-News&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out VICE News for more: http://vicenews.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow VICE News here:&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/vicenews&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/vicenews&amp;#10;Tumblr: http://vicenews.tumblr.com/&amp;#10;Instagram: http://instagram.com/vicenews&amp;#10;More videos from the VICE network: https://www.fb.com/vicevideo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#VICEonHBO"
