    label "q54j35z3fPQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-18T12:18:54Z"
    title "How to Become a Blockchain Developer? [Complete web3 Developer Roadmap]"
    description "In this video, Harpal talk about a complete blockchain developer roadmap you can follow to become a web3 developer.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Moralis Docs: https://docs.moralis.io/?utm_source=Ishan+Sharma+YouTube&amp;#38;utm_medium=YT+Description&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Ishan+Sharma+Moralis&amp;#10;Ethereum Boilerplate (with React): https://github.com/ethereum-boilerplate/ethereum-boilerplate?utm_source=Ishan+Sharma+YouTube&amp;#38;utm_medium=YT+Description&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Ishan+Sharma+Moralis&amp;#10;Moralis Website: https://moralis.io/?utm_source=Ishan+Sharma+YouTube&amp;#38;utm_medium=YT+Description&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Ishan+Sharma+Moralis&amp;#10;Join Moralis Discord: https://moralis.io/mage?utm_source=Ishan+Sharma+YouTube&amp;#38;utm_medium=YT+Description&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Ishan+Sharma+Moralis&amp;#10;Moralis YouTube Videos: https://youtube.com/c/MoralisWeb3?utm_source=Ishan+Sharma+YouTube&amp;#38;utm_medium=YT+Description&amp;#38;utm_campaign=Ishan+Sharma+Moralis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;How to become a web3 developer: https://bit.ly/3EYWnml&amp;#10;(A step by step roadmap to become a blockchain developer)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;According to https://remoteok.com/remote-blockchain-jobs the average salary of a remote blockchain developer is over $100K/year.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can connect with Harpal on Twitter: https://twitter.com/HarpalJadeja11&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; Instagram: https://bit.ly/ishansharma7390ig&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join MarkitUpX Discord Server: https://discord.gg/SqzaqqydhN&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Timestamps&amp;#10;0:00 Video starts&amp;#10;0:30 Introduction&amp;#10;0:52 What is web3 and how is it different from web2?&amp;#10;2:35 Sponsored by Moralis&amp;#10;3:30 Complete web3 roadmap&amp;#10;10:09 Why are we not talking about Bitcoin for building dApps?&amp;#10;11:14 What if a function call goes in an infinite loop?&amp;#10;13:35 Solidity Alternatives&amp;#10;14:00 Learn blockchain development in public&amp;#10;14:50 Participate 