a Tripod: https://amzn.to/33RTohW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128184;Tags&amp;#128184;&amp;#10;ali solanki,blockchain developer roadmap,blockchain developer,blockchain development roadmap,blockchain development for beginners,where to learn blockchain development,getting started with blockchain development,how to become a blockchain developer,ethereum developer,ethereum development,solidity development,how i learnt blockchain development in 30 days,ali solanki blockchain,blockchain development resources&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128156;Hashtags&amp;#128156;&amp;#10;#alisolanki #blockchain #cryptocurrency&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All the videos on this channel are for educational purposes only and I'm not a financial advisor.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you liked &amp;#128077; this video, then do consider SUBSCRIBING &amp;#128308; to the channel and press the BELL icon &amp;#128276; so that you never miss out on any uploads!"
