    id 167
    label "dEG2jLAUdK0"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-26T16:47:47Z"
    title "7 Reasons Why Crypto And Blockchain Have Value"
    description "The most common questions I get from traditional finance professionals is, &amp;#34;what is the utility of cryptocurrency?&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Most people have no idea what the actual value of blockchain and cryptocurrency is. So in this video, I go over 7 different utility functions of cryptocurrency to help traditional investors understand how it creates value.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please share this video with someone that does not understand the value of crypto and blockchain but has a desire to learn.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you are an accredited investor and want exposure to cryptocurrency. Click this link to learn more about our hedge fund and book a call if you want to speak to us:&amp;#10;https://info.orcacapital.fund/ocf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What other utility functions does crypto have?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Let me know in the comments section below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9935; Tired of having to consistently manage your crypto portfolio? Want a proven hedge against a potential bear market? Apply for our newest passive income, done-for-you program that allows nearly any person to get started in making income by running validator nodes and crypto mining machines:&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3LJqn85&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128200; Do you have at least 6 figures in your portfolio? Considering joining our highest level mastermind (QCM). Click the link below to see if you qualify!&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3mpoN0E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127770; Looking for quality information, data, market analysis, fundamental reviews on projects and trades you can follow from a professional? Join the most value packed program:&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3qfW2qZ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129297; Interested in learning how to make passive income with your crypto portfolio? Learn the top 5 ways to leverage your portfolio to generate passive income streams. Click the link below to learn more:&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3J7SJsr&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128240; Just getting your feet wet in cryptocurrency? Want to start understanding how the market works and cutting edge crypto projects? Subscribe to our bi-weekly newsletter here:&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3m4wWrk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128176; Join The 0 Percent Free Discord Channel : discord.gg/0percent&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Follow Jeff on Social Media:&amp;#10;YouTube: https://bit.ly/3veW5Wg&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/jeffsekinger&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/jeff.sekinger&amp;#10;Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/jeffsekinger4&amp;#10;Website: https://www.jeffsekinger.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#JeffSekinger #Cryptocurrency #AssetManagement #Bitcoin #Crypto&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This information is for educational purposes only. It is not, and should not be construed as, investment advice. You should seek proper legal, accounting, and financial advice from a local certified attorney, certified professional accountant, and certified financial advisor that is familiar with your situation, circumstances, and the laws in your jurisdiction."
