    title "Utilizing BSV blockchain to verify academic certificates | Dr Mohamed Al Hemairy | #GBC22"
    description "At the BSV Global Blockchain Convention in Dubai, Dr. Mohamed Al Hemairy, head of Technology Transfer Office at the #UniversityofSharjah, addressed the topic of untamed usage of fake certificates and how the university is working towards eliminating this unethical practice by moving the process from issuing and verifying all academic certificates onto the #BSVblockchain.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Hit #Subscribe &amp;#38; #HitTheBell so you don't miss out on any new videos!&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Our Links:&amp;#10;Facebook   &amp;#9658; https://www.facebook.com/realcoingeek/&amp;#10;Twitter      &amp;#9658; https://twitter.com/realcoingeek&amp;#10;Instagram &amp;#9658; https://www.instagram.com/coingeek_official/&amp;#10;LinkedIn      &amp;#9658; https://www.linkedin.com/company/coingeek&amp;#10;Telegram  &amp;#9658; https://t.me/RealCoinGeekDiscussion&amp;#10;Web          &amp;#9658; https://coingeek.com&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;CoinGeek is the authority on blockchain technology, with a focus on the original #Bitcoin, Bitcoin Satoshi Vision (BSV).&amp;#10; &amp;#10;CoinGeek provides you timely news on the latest developments in the industry and features the brightest and most creative minds in the community to give you the best insights on the current state and direction of the technology."
