    description "The video contains all the information one needs to know, to understand about the scope of Blockchain Development in India.&amp;#10;Guest: Shivam Sharma&amp;#10;Shivam is currently a blockchain developer at Polygon (previously Matic). He has worked for multiple companies both Indian and US based as a blockchain developer. He is a 2021 CS passout from VIT, Vellore. You can contact him on:&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/0xSharma&amp;#10;https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivam691999/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;List of Resources discussed in the video:&amp;#10;Hands On Course Site:&amp;#10;https://cryptozombies.io/&amp;#10;Recommended Youtube channels:&amp;#10;Eat The Blocks: https://www.youtube.com/c/EatTheBlocks&amp;#10;Dapp university: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY0xL8V6NzzFcwzHCgB8orQ&amp;#10;Finematics: https://www.youtube.com/c/Finematics/videos&amp;#10;Paid Courses:&amp;#10;Consesys: https://consensys.net/academy/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Questions answered by the guest:&amp;#10;How hard it is to get an entry level job as a blockchain developer?&amp;#10;Salary of a Blockchain developer in India?&amp;#10;Roadmap to become a blockchain developer?&amp;#10;Some Insights shared by Shivam from his experience in the field.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wanna contact me? How sweet, &amp;#10;Ping me on LinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/namanmonga&amp;#10;Will be happy to help.&amp;#10;Branding and Graphics by : https://linkedin.com/in/hardikmonga/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please give the video a like if you liked the content. Subscribe if you wanna see more such insightful content.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tags:&amp;#10;blockchain developer course&amp;#10;blockchain&amp;#10;blockchain developer&amp;#10;blockchain developer roadmap&amp;#10;blockchain technology&amp;#10;blockchain roadmap&amp;#10;blockchain development&amp;#10;learn blockchain development&amp;#10;how to learn blockchain development&amp;#10;how to become a blockchain developer&amp;#10;blockchain course&amp;#10;block chain&amp;#10;how to be