    title "Professional Certificate Program In Blockchain | Blockchain Developer Course | Simplilearn"
    description "Professional Blockchain Certification Training, designed for all, includes world class instructions, outcome-centric bootcamps, and hands-on projects. Carefully curated with IIT Kanpur, this blockchain course will give you insights into real-world blockchain applications. This Blockchain certification course covers concepts of Bitcoin, Hyperledger, Ethereum, Ripple, and Multichain blockchain platforms. Also, learn how to set up a private blockchain network using Hyperledger Composer, and deploy smart contracts on Ethereum.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Key Features:&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Blockchain Certification by IIT Kanpur&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; 70+ hours of applied learning&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; 4+ hands-on projects in integrated labs&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Masterclasses from IIT Kanpur faculty&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Program Details&amp;#10;This Blockchain course covers concepts of Bitcoin, Hyperledger, Ethereum, Ripple and Multichain blockchain platforms. Also, learn how to set up a private blockchain network using Hyperledger Composer, and deploy smart contracts on Ethereum.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What are the eligibility criteria for this Blockchain Certification Program with IIT Kanpur?&amp;#10;Professional Certificate Program in Blockchain is suitable for everyone but is highly recommended for people with a technical background. This Blockchain online course is ideal for professionals like support professionals, technology or solution architects, developers, business analysts, product managers, team leads, and project managers.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What should I expect from this Professional Blockchain Certification Training by IIT Kanpur?&amp;#10;As a part of this Professional Blockchain Certification Training by IIT Kanpur, you will receive the following:&amp;#10;&amp;#9989;Blockchain Certification by IIT Kanpur&amp;#10;&amp;#9989;Masterclasses from IIT Kanpur faculty&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Skills Covered:&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Cryptography and Cryptocurrency&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Bitcoin&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Distributed ledger&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Hyperledger&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Ethereum &amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Blockchain&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Consensus&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Transactions&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Work flows&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Networks&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Learn more at: https://www.simplilearn.com/blockchain-certification-training-course?utm_campaign=IntroVideo&amp;#38;utm_medium=Description&amp;#38;utm_source=youtube&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more information about Simplilearn&amp;#8217;s courses, visit: &amp;#10;- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Simplilearn &amp;#10;- Twitter: https://twitter.com/simplilearn &amp;#10;- LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/simplilearn&amp;#10;- Website: https://www.simplilearn.com&amp;#10;- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/simplilearn_elearning&amp;#10;- Telegram Mobile: https://t.me/simplilearnupdates&amp;#10;- Telegram Desktop: https://web.telegram.org/#/im?p=@simplilearnupdates&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get the Simplilearn app: https://simpli.app.link/OlbFAhqMqgb"
