    title " is the future"
    description "I fully agree that the crypto market is in its infancy, that it can now be compared to the internet of the 90's and that this amazing technology will soon explode and become a mainstream.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Let's not forget that this does not mean that Bitcoin or Ethereum will be the winner. Remember what I needed when the internet came along? We needed a search engine. We now have Google, which we use successfully and is currently one of the largest technology companies, but does anyone know the other engines that appeared in the beginning? Let's not forget that Google was neither the first nor the only search engine.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;That is why it is not necessary for the winning crypto project or projects to be among those that exist now."
