    title "Teslas Energy Business | Autobidder is the Future!"
    description "In this short video, I want to make a connection between Tesla&amp;#8217;s energy business and blockchain technology which I don&amp;#8217;t think this is something that many people are aware of. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Now, you may have heard of Tesla&amp;#8217;s &amp;#34;Autobidder&amp;#34; software, but that&amp;#8217;s only part of the discussion...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FEATURED:&amp;#10;- Recent Long-Form Tesla Podcast Episode: https://anchor.fm/theinvestingopportunity/episodes/Teslas-Past--Present--Future-TSLA-Stock-w-James-Ross-eockde&amp;#10;- https://grayscale.co/insights/valuing-bitcoin/&amp;#10;- https://ark-invest.com/analyst-research/use-case-for-blockchain/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128640;  SUPPORT THE CHANNEL ON PATREON&amp;#10;&amp;#9670; Patreon https://www.patreon.com/theinvestingopportunity&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patrons:&amp;#10;&amp;#8227; Disruptive Innovation&amp;#8212;https://bit.ly/3l2kWnw &amp;#8227; Bob Wills &amp;#8227; Ronil Patel &amp;#8227; Kenneth Cheng &amp;#8227; Paul Payne &amp;#8227; Lawrence Wong&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128588;  BECOME A MEMBER OF THE CHANNEL&amp;#10;&amp;#9670; Join https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMClgRAPUBAtuZgUaKW4-8w/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Futurists: &amp;#10;&amp;#8227; Sam &amp;#8227; Eric Vevang &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Investors:&amp;#10;&amp;#8227; Mitch Schierbeek &amp;#8227; Mohamad Khan &amp;#8227; Bharat Jauhari &amp;#8227; &amp;#26446;&amp;#24681;&amp;#26093; &amp;#8227; Leopoldo Silva &amp;#8227; &amp;#37284;&amp;#27833;&amp;#30722;&amp;#31958; &amp;#8227; Nirmal Kumar &amp;#8227; kirkster88 &amp;#8227; MYUNGJOON KIM &amp;#8227; gaby abergel &amp;#8227; X Gamer &amp;#8227; Jonathan &amp;#8227; K NPKJH &amp;#8227; MonWei Lin &amp;#8227; &amp;#52397;&amp;#52632; &amp;#8227; &amp;#51312;&amp;#51221;&amp;#51068; &amp;#8227; Aleksandrs Dmitrijevs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FEEDBACK &amp;#10;&amp;#9670; Requests https://forms.gle/dAdCLdMXPnFyqvoy9&amp;#10;&amp;#9670; General Feedback https://forms.gle/NfDDbN85L1fvcMT78&am