  [
    id 291
    label "11PmTCAMtRQ"
    step 0
    date "2018-10-13T19:48:01Z"
    title "Blockchain for Smart Homes - Proof of Concept (IoTeX  NKN)"
    description "IoTeX &amp;#38; NKN collaborate to create a decentralized alternative to smart home management and the sharing economy - &amp;#34;the Airbnb of the Future&amp;#34;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For this proof of concept, we integrated several lightweight IoT devices (smart locks, thermostats, lights) to the blockchain. We then developed a DApp that allows users to control and delegate access to their smart homes and devices, in a fully P2P fashion. The DApp runs on NKN's highly scalable P2P communication network and IoTeX's IoT-focused smart contract platform. It is our first step in redefining how the sharing economy operates - enabling homeowners to control their smart homes and data, and providing a custom rental experience for guests.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We will be unveiling a live demo of our proof of concept at the Telecom Infrastructure Project (TIP) Summit in London on October 16-17. Stay tuned for more updates by following our official channels:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NKN&amp;#10;Website: nkn.org&amp;#10;Twitter: @NKN_ORG&amp;#10;Telegram: t.me/nknorg&amp;#10;Medium: medium.com/NKN_ORG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;IoTeX&amp;#10;Website: iotex.io&amp;#10;Twitter: @iotex_io&amp;#10;Telegram: t.me/IoTeXGroup&amp;#10;Medium: medium.com/iotex"
    channeltitle "IoTeX Official"
