    id 292
    label "Ps5l7EfXnBs"
    step 0
    date "2022-01-27T12:29:48Z"
    title "Meike Krautscheid: Discovering The Power Of Blockchain Solutions | CG Conversations"
    description "In this episode of #CGConversations, Charles Miller talks to Meike Krautscheid, who is now officially the Chief Commercial Officer (CCO) and lead blockchain consultant of SmartLedger, to discuss what her new role entails, the wide array of solutions SmartLedger is able to provide as well as the various types businesses they have helped, and their new product Blockchain NFT ticketing system, &amp;#8216;TicketMint&amp;#8217;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8220;Imagine we are providing the whole ticketing service, not only with the NFT tickets, but also connected with our partners Omniscape, Transmira with AR VR. It&amp;#8217;s like spreading all over the world&amp;#8221; Krautscheid said.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Charles and Meike also discussed the ESG project, the negativity around the idea of Bitcoin, the interest in SmartLedger in Europe, Asia, and North America. And at the end, Charles highlights Meike&amp;#8217;s music career.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;=============================================================&amp;#10;Sign up for our newsletter to get CoinGeek to get the latest cryptocurrency news and blockchain information! https://coingeek.com/&amp;#10;Interested in learning about Bitcoin and blockchain? Read our Bitcoin for Beginners section here: https://coingeek.com/bitcoin101/&amp;#10;If you have a Bitcoin SV Project idea, we&amp;#8217;d like to know about it. Submit your Bitcoin investment idea so we can launch your business right away! https://coingeek.com/bitcoin-ventures/&amp;#10;Be part of the next CoinGeek Conference.! https://coingeekconference.com/&amp;#10;=============================================================&amp;#10;Get more information about Bitcoin SV today! https://bitcoinsv.com/"
