    step 0
    date "2022-02-19T13:00:17Z"
    title "blockchAIn"
    description "Alison McDowell returns to &amp;#8220;What&amp;#8217;s Left?&amp;#8221; to talk with Jessica, Kenny and Andy about blockchain. Its not just about Bitcoin and digital currency, but about laying the architecture for the Fourth Industrial revolution so the internet of things can become the internet of bodies and all society can be restructured around data collection, surveillance and replacing people with things.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To see all our episodes go to:&amp;#10;What&amp;#8217;s Left? Website:&amp;#10; https://what-s-left.webnode.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us @:  &amp;#10;https://what-s-left.webnode.com/contact/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to What&amp;#8217;s Left? on Telegram:&amp;#10;https://t.me/whatisleft&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Find out more about our anti-mandate group: Workers &amp;#38; Students for Choice&amp;#10;https://www.askhealthyquestions.com/ws4choice&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wrench in the Gears&amp;#10;https://wrenchinthegears.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fabio Vighi&amp;#10;https://thephilosophicalsalon.com/the-central-bankers-long-covid-emergency-noise-and-conspiracys-best-kept-secret/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Previous What&amp;#8217;s Left? Episodes&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Last Week:  Our 4th Industrial Future is Now!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/e88s4WRA5eE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;COP26&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/cIfFPpLzxWM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Internet of Bodies&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/NDAV2oOM0As&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Socialism, Science &amp;#38; Diego Rivera&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/E1LkyE2K6fI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ITunes and Spotify only show our last 150 episodes:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Podcasts:&amp;#10;iTunes: &amp;#10;https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/whats-left-now-who-we-are-and-why-we-are-doing-this/id1409349552&amp;#160;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;YouTube:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg2LquMHl9ACwxZbo5WLn2w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rumble: &amp;#10;https://rumble.com/c/c-1302454&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Spotify:&amp;#10;https://open.spotify.com/show/4RGc1LFhlXRK0slZLRIVix