    description "Vineet Budki, venture capitalist and CEO of Cypher Capital gives a timeline for when 10% to 15% of the world&amp;#8217;s population will be on blockchain in some capacity, and discusses what&amp;#8217;s needed to get there with David Lin, anchor for Kitco News at the Paris Blockchain Summit. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sponsored by Okra Finance - Permissioned DeFi Composable Index and Execution Platform&amp;#10;For more information visit: &amp;#10;Website: https://okra.finance&amp;#10;Twitter: @okra_finance&amp;#10;LinkedIn: Okra-Finance&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow David Lin on Twitter: @davidlin_TV (https://twitter.com/davidlin_TV)&amp;#10;Follow Kitco News on Twitter: @KitcoNewsNOW (https://twitter.com/KitcoNewsNOW)&amp;#10;Follow Cypher Capital on Twitter: @cypher_capital (https://twitter.com/cypher_capital)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 - Cypher Capital&amp;#10;3:54 - Major crypto trends &amp;#10;5:30 - Bitcoin adoption&amp;#10;8:14 - Investment criteria &amp;#10;9:19 - Banking with cryptos&amp;#10;10:30 - 1 billion crypto users  &amp;#10;12:00 - Transacting with Bitcoin &amp;#10;12:56 - 15% of world population will use blockchain&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Bitcoin #blobkchain #crypto &amp;#10;__________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;Kitco News is the world&amp;#8217;s #1 source of metals market information. Our videos feature interviews with prominent industry figures to bring you market-affecting insights, with the goal of helping people make informed investment decisions. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to our channel to stay up to date on the latest insights moving the metals markets. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more breaking news, visit http://www.kitco.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on social media: &amp;#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/KitcoNews/?ref=br_rs &amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/kitconewsnow&amp;#10;StockTwits - https://stocktwits.com/kitconews&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Live gold price and charts: http://www.kitco.com/gold-price-t